 "about_text": "Anat Ebgi is a contemporary art gallery founded in 2012 by Anat Ebgi, with locations in Los Angeles on Wilshire Boulevard and in New York City's Tribeca. The gallery represents an intergenerational and international roster of emerging and established artists, and manages the estates of Tina Girouard and Gloria Klein. Its program emphasizes museum-caliber exhibitions and performances, including a historical survey marking the 50th anniversary of Womanhouse, and the global representation of eco-feminist artist Faith Wilding. Works by gallery artists are held in major American and international museum collections, including LACMA, MoMA, the Whitney, SFMOMA, and the Stedelijk Museum. The gallery participates regularly in international art fairs such as Art Basel, Frieze, The Armory Show, and The Art Show, and joined the Art Dealers Association of America in 2023.",
